          "end": 1411,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.510:block:1",
          "start": 747
        },
        "quote": "(b) No person while an official or employee of the City, or thereafter, shall use to their own advantage, or reveal, other than to the authorized representatives of the United States government, the State, or other government, in their official capacity, or as ordered by a court in a judicial proceeding, any information acquired under the authority of this chapter concerning any matter which is entitled to protection as a trade secret. Wastewater constituents and characteristics will not be recognized as confidential or subject to the trade secret limitations. (Ord. 19496 § 72, 12-21-10; Ord. 16388 § 8.10, 11-5-91. Code 1995 § 146-311. Formerly 14.80.600.)",
